<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2PEPOK.SFK 01-06-2,007 ADELINA QUEJ POKOMCHI Updated for DBL by G. Grasso and E. Canales, Dec 2012, standardization after migration to PT8 by A. Camus March, 2019.</book>
  <para style="h">2 PEDRO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pedro</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pedro</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 PEDRO</para>
  <para style="mt2">RE' I RUKAB' RUHUUJ I SAN PEDRO</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 PEDRO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Taaq'anik reje rusuqkiil k'uxliis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Re' hin i Simón Pedro, hin raj kamanoom, raj tahqaneel i Jesucristo. Inutz'ihb'aaj reje huuj wili aweh taq i hat, i areqem taq chik chi riij i nimanik xiik' naah loq'il re' inqanimaj i hoj. Re' i ruyeew qeh i qaDios, i QaJaaw Jesucristo, qaj Ko'loom korik wach ruk'ux. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh nee ta naq taq inak'ul i rotob'il i suq kiil k'uxliis ruuk' i runaab'jiik wach i Dios, i QaJaaw Jesucristo.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' na'ojb'al naa kianam taqe aj nimaneel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' Dios ruuk' i rajaawriik i ruyeew qeh i ajwaal wach chi qeh pan qak'achariik. Eh i ruk'uhtaaj qeh nik' wach rulooq'jiik naa qa'nam, noq xuyeew qeh chi naab'jik chi korik i xsik'wik cho qawach ruuk' i runimaal wach, eh ruuk' taqe i rukamaj xiik' naah loq'il. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruum taqe re', re' Dios wilik taqe i xuq'or cho rib'iral qeh xiik' naah nimaal kiwach, eh xiik' naah kiloq'il. Eh ruuk' taqe re', nee taq ti ehtrik i hat i rukorkiil wach ruk'ux i Dios, eh nee taq inako'leej awiib' chuwach i ma' holohik ta laj na'ojb'al, re' ruk'am chaloq i ruk'axariik wach iraaj ma' raaj b'anarik ayu' wach ak'al. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' nimanik taq k'ahchi' kaat, inchol taq achopom ak'ux chutiqariik naah ruuk' i holohik laj na'ojb'al chi riij i re', re' chik i holohik laj kapeew, <verse number="6" style="v" />chi riij i re', re' chik i ruq'ilariik taq awiib' cha wib'il awiib' chi riij i re', re' chik i kuyuuj, chi riij i re', re' chik i rulooq'jiik i Dios <verse number="7" style="v" />chi riij i re', re' chik i aajwanik iib' taq chawach, chi riij i re', re' chik i k'axooj.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Wila' i na a'n taq holohik laj na'ojb'al wili, wila' natiq taq naah rub'anariik, re' taq aak'achariik ma' nee ta nkahnik chi xama' xta neerutiq wach, eh ni xata nee taq i nayeew chi re' chi ma' re' i runaab'jiik wach i QaJaaw Jesucristo. <verse number="9" style="v" />Raaj awach i ma' rub'an ta taqe na'ojb'al wili je' rukab' i mutz'wach oon je' rukab' i ma' nilwik ta chi korik, ruum sahchinaq chik paruk'ux chi xtz'ajarik, eh xsacharik chik wach taqe ru mahk. <verse number="10" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' taq i hat hermano, xa re' taq chik cha a'n i xusik' taq cho wii' awach, eh i xatrupab'aa' taq cho wii' i Dios. Reh chi ma' jaruuj taq chik neetiq'ehb'ik pamahk. <verse number="11" style="v" />Eh chi je' re', ma' nim k'ayeew ta noq nee taq tikojaarik pa runimaal rajaawriik i wilik chi juneliik, re' i QaJaaw Jesucristo i qaj Ko'loom.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin ma' naa ta nukanaam ruq'orariik taq aweh taqe re', atoob' ta aweht'al taq chik, atoob' ta nanimaj taq chik i korik i hat taq tijimaj cho wii'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Re' q'oreel nik' chik najtiil k'achalkiin ayu' wach ak'al, re' hin rub'ehel chi weh chi xa jarpech pa' neenwik'saj ruq'orariik taq pan axikin aak'uhb'aaljiik wili. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ruum re' QaJaaw Jesucristo xuyeew chik weh chi naab'jik chi naa nukanaam chi jumehq'iil i k'acharik ayu' wach ak'al. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruum aj re', re' hin ko naa nunik'eem nuq'iij taq chak'uhb'aljiik, reh chi noq hin-oq chik kamnaq, ko nee wo' taq ink'ulik cho panak'ux i xnuq'or taq aweh.</para>
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i xi ilwik reh i runimaal wach i ruloq'il i Jesucristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' i xatqatijej taq wii' chi riij i rajaawriik, chi riij i ruk'uliik ruka'peech i QaJaaw Jesucristo ma' xata k'utaaj re' ruuk' intz'aqarik wach chi xa jot'b'al, ruum re' hoj xti ruuk' naq'qawach qilom cho wach i QaJaaw chi wilik runimaal i ruloq'il. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eh xqilow wo' noq xye'arik runimaal wach ruloq'il i Jesucristo ruum i Ajaab'ees Dios, re' noq xq'orob'jik cho ruum i Dios ruuk' i loq'laj q'orik wili: Re' wili i Wak'uun q'e' nuk'axam, eh ruuk' i reh ch'iklik nuk'ux, inki. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh xti re' hoj xoj ib'irinik reh i q'orik re' re' chi pan taxaaj xchalik, noq wilkooj ruuk' i QaJaaw chinaah i yuuq' xiik' naah loq'il.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ruuk' i re', inqakoj rehtaal chi re' k'uhb'aal kiq'orom chaloq taqe i jalal ruq'oral i Dios xti korik, eh rub'ehel chi nayeew taq ak'ux chunimjiik. Re' k'uhb'aal re' re' je' rukab' i saqumb'al insihq'inik pan q'equm, uyumb'al reh i rusaqumaal i q'iij korehtaal i nelik chaloq i ch'umiil ihqen q'iij, reh chi naa rusihq'eem taq cho paam awánima. <verse number="20" style="v" />Xa re' la', peet taq chanab'eej chi ma' awach taj i xa runa'ojb'al riib' noq nee ruq'or i k'uhb'aal kiq'orom chaloq taqe i jalal ruq'oral i Dios, re' kitz'ihb'aam chaloq pan santo laj huuj, <verse number="21" style="v" />ruum re' taqe i jalal ruq'oral i Dios ma' nik' ta xkiq'or chaloq i k'uhb'aal chi xata pankik'ux xchalik. Raaj kamanoom la' Dios taqe parub'ihnaal i reh xiq'orik, eh re' i Santolaj Uxlab'al xk'amwik cho kib'eeh.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' taqe i kik'uhtanik reh i xachukuj q'orik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JUD 1:3-13">Jud 3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eh chi kixilak i tinamit Israel xi wihik chaloq taqe i jalal tii chik ruq'oral i Dios xkian kiib', aj chukul q'orik taqe. Je' wo' re' na' kiwih-oq taq chaxilak i hat i naakik'uhtaniik reh chi q'eeqmaal i xachukuj q'orik injot'wik. Eh ruuk' i re', ma' naa ta kikojom chi Dios i QaJaaw, re' i xko'linik naq cho keh. Ruum taqe i re', jinaj i runimaal ti' k'axik naa ruchaliik chikinaah chi jumehq'iil. <verse number="2" style="v" />Re' taqe re', ma' k'isiin wo' naa runimaniik keh chub'anariik i kima'tob'laj tuskil naa kik'uhtaam. Eh kuum i keh, naa ruq'orariik chi re' chi ma' re' i xti korik laj b'eeh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Eh ruum i kituskil ree tumiin, naa taq kaat kelq'aam ruuk' i ruk'uhtjiik taq aweh i xachukuj q'orik. Xa re' la' re' keh, ma' naa ta rik'iik chikiij chi naakiye'ariik pa runimaal ti' k'axik, ruum xa najtir wo' inkorjik cho wach chi je' re' i naakik'ulum.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Re' Dios ma' xukuy ta wo' cho kimahk i ánjel i ximahkunik chaloq xukut la' taqe pa runimaal tojb'al mahk. Eh xub'ak' taqe chi karena pa runimaal sihtuum ar nakiwihiik korehtaal i rureq ruq'ijil i q'ataj q'orik. <verse number="5" style="v" />Eh re' Dios ma' xukuy ta cho kimahk k'achareel najtir q'iij. Xuyeew la' chaloq i runimaal jab' wach ak'al korehtaal xnujik i ha' chikinaah ruum yiib' wach kina'ojb'al. Xa re' wo' i Noé xuko'leej, re' ixq'orik cho rib'iral i korik laj k'acharik, eh wuquub' chik taqe i ruch'ihil i Noé xuko'leej i Dios. <verse number="6" style="v" />Re' wo' Dios xq'atwik i q'orik chikinaah i tinamit Sodoma, i Gomorra, chi xusach kiwach ruuk' q'aaq' korehtaal xichaajrik, k'uhtb'al reh chi je' re' i naakik'ulum i tinamit na' chub'an i kib'aniik reh i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' Dios xuko'leej i Lot, jinaj winaq korik wach ruk'ux, eh inchalik ruyot'kiil i ránima noq i rilow i kima'tob'laj tuskil i tinamit re' re' yiib' wach kina'ojb'al. <verse number="8" style="v" />Re' winaq re' re', i korik wach ruk'ux, ar xpatinik chi kixilak i tinamit yiib' wach kina'ojb'al. Re' reh xik'ik chi ti' k'axik i atoob'laj ránima, ruum rajlaal q'iij i rilow irib'iraj i yiib' wach na'ojb'al inki a'n i tinamit re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Je' re' noq re' QaJaaw reht'al nik' wach kiko'ljiik i rub'an chuwach i pajarik inchalik chikinaah i kiq'asam kiib' reh. Eh reht'al wo' hoq nik' wach noq i ruyeew taqe panti' k'axik i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al korehtaal i rureq ruq'ijil i q'ataj q'orik. <verse number="10" style="v" />Re' Dios naa wo' taqe ruye'em panti' k'axik i kib'anik reh i ch'uwa' wach na'ojb'al, eh ma' imponik ta panaq'kiwach i rajaawriik i QaJaaw Jesucristo. Re' keh xa q'et q'et taqe. Xa teheeh kiwach. Eh ma' kiyo'jik ta chu b'ajariik taqe k'achareel nimaq wach kajaawriik wilkeeb' pan taxaaj. <verse number="11" style="v" />Raaj taqe i ánjel, atoob' ta q'e' wo' naq kow taqe, eh wilik wo' naq kajaawriik chikiwach taqe chukul q'orik re' re', ma' ne'inkikapaaj ta ruq'atariik i q'orik chuwach i Dios ruuk' b'ajooj chikinaah taqe k'achareel re' re'.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Re' taqe re' xa je' kikab' chikop, xa re' i keht'al cho chi kaasb'al inki a'n Eh xa chi kaasb'al kik'amam chaloq chi naakichopariik, eh naa kikanteesjiik, xama' tiklik ta kiq'orik chi riij i xa chib'ih jariik, atoob' ta ma' nkireq chi riij. Eh xa je' kikimik chikop noq naa kikanteesjiik. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh naakik'ulum jilow i ti' k'axik kianam reh i tokoom, xa se'eel chik kiwach, xa nkich'ikaa' chik kik'ux chub'anariik i kiyiib' wach na'ojb'al. Eh xa k'ixb'ilaal kib'anik noq ti kuhch'ihleej taq ruuk' aninq'iij i na a'n xa nkich'ikaa' chik kik'ux ruuk' inkik'ax wach rub'aan re' inkikoj chi jot'b'al. <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' keh ma' jino'q ixoq neenkilow wach chi ma' ta neenkotwaaj k'oyomal ruuk'. Eh ma' nq'uhtik ta kik'ux chub'anariik i mahk. Inkitaqchi'ij taqe i komajaa' kow kik'ux. Eh q'e' inkik'ax wach i b'ehomal, kiq'eb'em kiib' chi jumpech. <verse number="15" style="v" />Re' taqe re' sahchinaq i kina'ojb'al, ruum xkiq'eb' chi riij kik'ux i korik laj b'eeh. Eh re' chik xkik'am naah i ruyiib' wach na'ojb'al, aj chukul q'orik, Balaam rub'ihnaal, rak'uun i Beor. Re' reh xraaj naq rureqem cho rutumiin chub'anariik i yiib' wach na'ojb'al. <verse number="16" style="v" />Re' reh xq'ilarik ruuk' i ru mahk xub'an ruum i rub'uuruux ma' nchol ta q'orik, je' ruq'oral winaq xq'orob'jik wii'. Ruuk' i re', ma' xye'arik ta chik q'ab' reh chi xub'an i ruyojel laj na'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taqe i aj k'uhtan chukul q'orik re' re' xama' xta kikamaj. Xa je' kikab' i rujuleel ha' ma' xta ha' chupaam. Eh xa je' kikab' i suutz' k'ul inooj ruum i kowlaj teew, ye'ooj chikiij chi naakiye'ariik chi juneliik pa runimaal q'equm. <verse number="18" style="v" />Re' taqe re' xa reh reh inkiq'or ruuk' i nimaq wach q'orik xama' xta rutiq wach. Ruuk' tuskil, ruuk' i xa chib'ih chik jariik i yiib' wach chi b'anarik i ruk'ax wach i kiti'jolal, inkik'am wo' chik rub'eeh chub'anariik i re' ma' re' taqe i xa k'axik wo' tii noq xi elik cho pamahk. <verse number="19" style="v" />Je' wili inkiq'or: Re' taq i hat ma' awach ta chik naa rutaaq'aniik taq aweh ruuk' taq i naa a'nam, inki taqe. Xanaah re', xa ko choplik wo' cho kinaah i keh chub'anariik i ma' ruq'or korik laj na'ojb'al, ruum aha' wilik i rub'an i ju'jun, re' chik i re' inchopwik naah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Re' taqe i keht'aliim chik wach i QaJaaw Jesucristo i qaj Ko'loom, ma' inki a'n ta chik keh i mahk imb'aan wach ak'al. Eh wila' xkiyeew wo' chik q'ab' chi nee kiminarik chub'anariik i mahk re' re', eh wi xchoparik wo' chik kinaah ruum, xiik' chik naah yohb'alil wilkeeb' wii' chuwach i pampeet. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ruum aj re', q'e' naq chihooj chi keh chi ma' ta xkinab'eej pampeet i korik laj b'eeh, chuwach chi keht'al chik noq nee wo' chik inkikanaa' runimjiik i santo laj k'uhb'aal tijimaj taqe cho wii'. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eh kuuk' i keh xooj eloq wach i jinaj i korik laj q'orik i ruq'or chi je' wili: Re' tz'i' inooj wo' chik rureq' ruka'peech i ruxab'iik, eh re' aati't ahq kore' xub'an ritiin inooj wo' chik rutolej riib' pan ch'uwa', inki.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Re' ruk'uliik ruka'peech i QaJaaw Jesucristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat taq loq'laj hermano, re' wili i rukab' nuhuuj i nutz'ihb'aaj taq reje aweh. Eh chupaam kab'chel i nuhuuj i nutaq'aaj taq reje aak'uhb'aaljiik chi xa eliik-oq saq taq wach akapeb'aal. <verse number="2" style="v" />Eh k'oloq taq panak'ux i k'uhb'aal kiq'orom chaloq najtir q'iij taqe i santo laj jalal ruq'oral i Dios, je' wo' hoq i ruk'uhb'aal i QaJaaw Jesucristo i qaj Ko'loom, i xatkik'uhb'alej taq cho wii' taqe i raj tahqaneel.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Re' wili ajwaal wach chi peet taq neenanab'eej, chi pan kuxesb'al taqe ponoq wach reh i q'iij wilik i naakik'uliik iloq naa kikaqse'laam i q'orooj cho rib'iral, xa re' naa kianam i ruk'ax wach i kiti'jolal. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eh je' wili i naa kiq'orom: ¿Chib'ih reet noq xakomajaa' wo' ink'ulik ruka'peech i Jesucristo q'orooj chaloq? Yu'naak ma' k'isiin chik i qamaam qati't kamnaq chaloq. Eh xakomajaa' ta wo' chih injaljik wach i rutz'uhkriik chaloq i wach ak'al, inko'q taqe. <verse number="5" style="v" />Re' taqe re' xama' nkaaj ta kireqem chi riij chi re' taxaaj xa wilik wo' chaloq najtir cho q'iij. Eh chi ruuk' i ransil i ruq'oral i Dios xutz'uhkrisaj chaloq i wach ak'al panha', eh ruuk' ha' xuyejaa' chaloq. <verse number="6" style="v" />Eh ruuk' wo' ha' xuk'am chaloq i runimaal jab', xsachwik wach i wach ak'al najtir q'iij.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eh re' taqe taxaaj ruch'ihil i wach ak'al wilkeeb' yu'naak, ruuk' wo' ransil i ruq'oral i Dios molooj taqe chi q'aaq' naa rusachwiik kiwach. Re' wo' q'aaq' re' re' naa ruk'atwiik keh paruq'ijil i q'ataj q'orik, taqe i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hat taq loq'laj hermano, mansahchik taq panak'ux i wili: Chuwach i QaJaaw i jinaj q'iij je' nik'ik jino'q miil haab'. Eh re' jinaj miil haab' chuwach i reh xa je' nik'ik jinaj q'iij. <verse number="9" style="v" />Re' QaJaaw ma' chamlik ta chaloq chub'anariik i ruq'orom cho rib'iral, je' rukab' inkikapaaj i ju'jun. K'ahchi' la' rukuyum taq aawuyub'jiik i hat, ruum re' reh ma' raaj taj chi awach i neenkimik parumahk iraaj la' chi chu'nchel neenkiyot' i kik'ux chi riij i kimahk. <verse number="10" style="v" />Xa re' la', chi ma' eht'alimaj naa ruk'uliik iloq ruka'peech i QaJaaw Jesucristo, xa je' ink'u'loq jino'q i ajileq'. Eh naakiyojib'iik taqe i taxaaj ruuk' jinaj choqik naa rub'aan. Eh chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam taqe i taxaaj naa rusachariik kiwach ruuk' q'aaq'. Eh re' wach ak'al ruch'ihil taqe i wilkeeb' chupaam naa wo' kik'ahtik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Wila' je' re' na' sacharoq kiwach taqe i xa chib'ih jariik wilik, chib'ih reet noq ma' nee taq ti k'acharik pan santohiil i hat ¿Chib'ih reet noq ma' nee taq i nayeew ruloq'il i Dios? <verse number="12" style="v" />Je' re' noq, cha chop taq ak'ux chi ruyub'jiik i ruq'ijil i ruk'uliik i Dios. Chupaam i q'iij re' re', re' taqe i taxaaj naa rusachariik kiwach ruuk' q'aaq', eh chu'nchel i wilkeeb' chupaam naa kihab'ik ruum i xaq q'aaq'. <verse number="13" style="v" />Eh re' hoj, jinaj i ak' taxaaj, eh jinaj i ak' wach ak'al k'ahchi' quy-eem, re' ruq'orom cho rib'iral i Dios chi naa ruye'em qeh, re' taqe i naa ruwihiik wii' i korik, i otob'il.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Re' taq i hat loq'laj hermano, noq kok'ahchi' taq awuy-eem i rojiik eloq wach taqe re', xti cha chop taq ak'ux chi k'acharik parukorkiil, reh chi nee taq tik'ulik rureq i Dios pansuqkiil k'uxliis, chi ma' xta taq ruch'uwa'iil wach awánima, ni xata nee taq i rureq amahk. <verse number="15" style="v" />Chakoj taq rehtaal chi re' quyub'jiik ruuk' q'unil i rub'an i QaJaaw Jesucristo, re' raaj chi neenqareq i ko'lemb'al qiib'. Eh re' wo' re' i xutz'ihb'aaj taq reje aweh chupaam taqe ruhuuj i qaloq' laj hermano Pablo ruuk' i runa'ojb'al xye'arik cho reh ruum i Dios. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eh rutaq'aam wo' taq ruq'orariik aweh i re' chupaam taqe i ruhuuj, atoob' ta wilik i k'axik chi reqarik chi riij. Re' taqe i ma' xta kina'ojb'al, re' taqe i ma' kichopom ta kik'ux, inkiyoj wach i ruq'or chupaam taqe huuj re' re', je' rukab' noq inkiyoj wach i tz'ihb'amaj cho chupaam i santo laj huuj, re' inki a'n re' re' naa ruk'amwiik keh pantojb'al mahk.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Re' taq i hat loq'laj hermano, ruum chi noq taq xaweht'aliij taqe re', chawik'raaj taq awiib', reh chi ma' nee ta taq tikik'am reje chikiij ruuk' i jot'ooj taqe i yiib' wach kina'ojb'al, eh ni xata nee taq inkiyoj ak'ux ruuk' taq animaniik. <verse number="18" style="v" />Eh k'ahchi'-oq taq areqem chi riij chi korik runimjiik i QaJaaw Jesucristo, re' i qaj Ko'loom. Eh reh reh-oq wo' taq areqem i ruk'axb'al chi manlik. Re' ta naq i reh neenye'arik ruloq'il yu'naak, eh je' chi juneliik. Je' ta wo' naq re'.</para>
</usx>